capability codegen/generated-code  types and stubs generated from `.proto` files at build time
  heroes  refused: a generator would be a second tool beside `heroes`, and the language has no macros; a program reads its `.proto` files at run time and binds its records by their checked field names
  go      protoimpl, protoc-gen-go
  rust    prost-build, protobuf-codegen, prost_types::compiler::CodeGeneratorRequest, prost_types::compiler::CodeGeneratorResponse, prost_types::compiler::Version, prost_types::compiler::code_generator_response::File, prost_types::compiler::code_generator_response::Feature
  python  protoc's Python plugin, message_factory classes, reflection

capability registry/global  a registry of every type the program knows, shared by every call
  heroes  refused: the language has no mutable global; a `Schema` is a value the program holds and passes
  go      protoregistry.GlobalFiles, protoregistry.GlobalTypes, protoregistry.Files.RegisterFile, protoregistry.Types.RegisterMessage, RegisterEnum, RegisterExtension
  rust    -
  python  descriptor_pool.Default, symbol_database.Default, symbol_database.SymbolDatabase

dropped
  go      proto.Bool, proto.Int32, proto.Int64, proto.Uint32, proto.Uint64, proto.Float32, proto.Float64, proto.String, proto.ValueOrDefault, proto.ValueOrDefaultBytes, proto.ValueOrNil: pointers to scalars for generated code's optional fields; a `Message` holds a field or does not
  go      proto.MarshalOptions.MarshalState, proto.UnmarshalOptions.UnmarshalState, proto.MarshalOptions.UseCachedSize, proto.UnmarshalOptions.NoLazyDecoding, dynamicpb.Message.ProtoMethods, protoiface: the runtime's fast paths and lazy decoding
  go      protoregistry.Files.NumFiles, NumFilesByPackage, RangeFiles, RangeFilesByPackage, protoregistry.Types.NumMessages, NumEnums, NumExtensions, NumExtensionsByMessage, RangeMessages, RangeEnums, RangeExtensions, RangeExtensionsByMessage: a schema's maps are walked with `keys`
  go      dynamicpb.NewEnumType, dynamicpb.Message.String, the generated Get* accessors of the known types, structpb.NullValue_name, structpb.NullValue_value: type objects for a registry, a debug string, and generated plumbing
  rust    protobuf::CachedSize, protobuf::rt::CachedSize, protobuf::Lazy, protobuf::MessageField, protobuf::EnumOrUnknown, protobuf::Enum, protobuf::EnumFull, protobuf::MessageFull, protobuf::Oneof, protobuf::OneofFull, protobuf::rt::* (sizes, packed sizes and readers for generated code): the plumbing of generated code
  rust    prost::Name, prost::DecodeError, prost::EncodeError, prost::UnknownEnumValue, protobuf::Error: error types; a failure here is a code and a message
  python  message.DecodeError, message.EncodeError, message.Error, message.FrozenInstanceError, json_format.Error, json_format.ParseError, json_format.SerializeToJsonError, json_format.EnumStringValueParseError: exception classes; a failure here is a code and a message
  python  text_encoding.CEscape, text_encoding.CUnescape: the C escapes of the text format, which waits with it
  python  api_implementation, python_message, message.Message.SetInParent, message.Message.Extensions: the runtime's own machinery
